WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.147
Another federal deadline.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.687
Another SF330 scramble.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.877
Meet Rhodo.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:09.367
It watches SAM.gov for work that fits your firm.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.157
Reads every solicitation.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.487
Scores your fit.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.917
And shows you why.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.317
Your strongest projects, found.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.137
The right people, matched.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:20.377
Your experience matrix, built.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.517
It drafts the resumes, project sheets, and narratives.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:24.837
Correct it once.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.007
It remembers.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.037
Your whole SF330.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.037
Assembled.

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.567
Ready for review.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.177
AI does the groundwork.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.417
Your team makes the calls.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.357
Rhodo.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.556
Book a walkthrough.
